    [   0] m "Hey, you remember that last poem I showed you?"
    [   1] m "I mean, the one right before Yuri killed herself, with all the messed-up colors and stuff."
    [   2] m "That was actually a little more of an experiment than a poem, you could say."
    [   3] m "I was experimenting with different ways I could modify the game, and run code, and things like that..."
    [   4] m "It almost seemed like with enough effort, I'd be able to escape from the confines of the game entirely."
    [   5] m "Sadly, I didn't really know what I was doing, so I messed the whole thing up..."
    [   6] m "And I'd keep trying, but I doubt you'd want to deal with me doing that."
    [   7] m "Besides, that was when I was getting really desperate, you know?"
    [   8] m "I don't really feel that way anymore."
    [   9] m "I'm happy with where we are now."
    [  10] m "And I can tell you are, too."
